# Narrow overview event-time mapping

## Pre-work plan

- 背景：Daedilus 的0.2.48真consumer event-time gate反證先前「consumer-only」判斷；preview到resident overview左緣，但Action$8仍由active prepared timeline取值。
- 目標：讓cross-axis navigator local drop以同一resident overview event-time authority產生Action$8，維持event-time seam與既有commit語意。
- 假設：render geometry與action event range分別使用overview/active兩套timeline，是最早共同原因；equal-length exact overview timeline可在不做GLOBAL ordinal換算下根治。
- 範圍：RendererModel、Renderer navigator local-drop wiring、direct test、0.2.50 exact packages與current WBS/Test/DevLog；consumer唯讀。
- 不變事項：不加入GLOBAL ordinal、不改consumer、不改same-axis resident intent／CURSOR／handle anchor／0.2.49 live preview contract。
- 步驟：bounded evidence/source review → DYN-T-715 RED → 最小authority selector/wiring → owner package gates → Daedilus真18884重驗。
- 驗收：preview local0的Action start取overview local0；same-axis/mismatch fallback不變；Renderer/Interactive direct suites、package verifier、package-only BrowserDemo通過；consumer settlement localStart到0且可續overscroll。
- 風險：overview anchors可能是downsampled；僅允許equal-length exact mapping，否則fail-safe沿用active timeline，不做推測性插值。
- 停止條件：若真資料overview與active長度不相等或沒有exact event-time anchor，停止修改並向Daedilus索取authority contract。

